{
  "_readme": "Fill rules for the Sixty Chrome extension, served live from /api/ext/config, so editing this file changes every installed extension without a new release. For each portal: where agents add a listing, and how to find each field on that page (CSS selectors first, then visible label text). Labels below are a first pass from the public field names. Tighten them with real selectors once someone opens the actual PF Expert / Bayut add-listing forms (Chrome DevTools → right-click a field → Copy selector).",
  "version": 1,
  "portals": {
